imalnames.com/pins/120-traditional-scorpion-names.png\",\"image\"]\n23:[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"Onyx\",{\"href\":\"/scorpion-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 hover:text-primary transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Onyx\"}]\n24:[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"Shadow\",{\"href\":\"/scorpion-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 hover:text-primary transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Shadow\"}]\n25:[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"Hades\",{\"href\":\"/scorpion-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 hover:text-primary transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Hades\"}]\n26:[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"Ulysses\",{\"href\":\"/scorpion-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 hover:text-primary transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Ulysses\"}]\n27:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/scorpion-names/\",\"className\":\"text-primary hover:underline text-sm font-semibold\",\"children\":[\"See all \",\"scorpion\",\" names →\"]}]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\",\"children\":[\"About These \",\"Traditional\",\" \",\"Scorpion\",\" Names\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Looking for 120 traditional scorpion names? You have come to the right place. BestAnimalNames.com has curated a complete collection of traditional scorpion names handpicked from thousands of ideas submitted by pet owners worldwide. Whether you need a name for a new scorpion, a rescue scorpion, or just browsing for inspiration, this list of 120+ names has something for everyone. Our traditional scorpion name collection features carefully chosen names that stand out from classic favorites to one-of-a-kind ideas you will not find anywhere else. Each name has been selected for its charm, personality, and uniqueness, perfect for scorpion lovers who want something special. All our scorpion names are 100% free, no sign-up required.\"}]]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Tips for Choosing the Perfect \",\"Scorpion\",\" Name\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Naming your scorpion is one of the most personal and lasting decisions you will make as a pet owner. The right traditional scorpion name becomes part of your daily vocabulary, spoken hundreds of times over years of companionship. Here are five essential tips for choosing the perfect traditional name for your scorpion.\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3 list-decimal list-inside\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Say the name aloud several times before committing — traditional scorpion names should feel natural and joyful every time you call your pet.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Choose a name with clear consonant sounds that your scorpion can easily distinguish from background noise and everyday conversation.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Consider your scorpion's personality before finalizing. The most traditional name is the one that genuinely matches who your companion actually is.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Test your top three choices for a few days each. The name that consistently feels right during feeding, play, and cuddle time is your winner.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Involve your whole household in the decision. A traditional scorpion name should resonate with everyone who will use it daily for years to come.\"}]]}]]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 mb-8 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\",\"children\":\"Save This Idea\"}],[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/pins/120-traditional-scorpion-names.png\",\"alt\":\"120 Traditional Scorpion Names\",\"className\":\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl mx-auto shadow-md\",\"style\":{\"maxHeight\":\"400px\"}}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-3\",\"children\":[\"Pin this \",\"traditional\",\" \",\"scorpion\",\" names collection to your Pinterest board\"]}]]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Related \",\"Scorpion\",\" Name Collections\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"400-majestic-scorpion-names\",{\"href\":\"/ideas/400-majestic-scorpion-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 rounded-lg p-3 text-center border border-amber-200 hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"400 Majestic Scorpion Names\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1\",\"children\":[\"400\",\"+ names\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"300-enchanted-scorpion-names\",{\"href\":\"/ideas/300-enchanted-scorpion-names/\",\"className\":\"bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 rounded-lg p-3 text-center border border-amber-200 hover:border-primary/30 transition-color